{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"37240f583e914ba42181e29fd451e0e08b4e7c4e2af1563522da6f6a9285f631","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":62,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["錫安蒙主喜悅"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["為了錫安我不再緘默，",{"text":"為了耶路撒冷我不再沉默，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"直到她的公義如明光照耀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的救恩如燃燒的火把。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶路撒冷啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"列國必看見你的公義，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"列王必看見你的榮耀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華必親口賜你一個新名字。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必成為耶和華手中的華冠，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你上帝手上的榮冕。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你不再被稱為「棄婦」，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的土地不再被稱為「荒涼之地」。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你要被稱為「主所喜悅的」，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的土地要被稱為「有夫之婦」，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為耶和華必喜愛你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"做你土地的丈夫。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的人民必娶你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像少男娶少女；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝必喜愛你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如同新郎喜愛新娘。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"耶路撒冷啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我已在你城牆上設立守望者。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們晝夜不停地禱告。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"呼求耶和華的人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們不可歇息，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要常常敦促祂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"直到祂建立耶路撒冷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使耶路撒冷得到普世的讚美。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華憑祂的右手，憑祂大能的臂膀起誓說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「我再也不會把你的五穀給你的仇敵吃，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"再也不會讓外族人喝你辛苦釀製的新酒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"收割的人必享受五穀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"讚美耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摘葡萄的人必在我聖所的院內喝酒。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"你們要出去，去城外，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為百姓修平道路。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要修築，修築大道，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"清除石頭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為萬民豎立旗幟。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，耶和華已經向普世宣告：「要對少女錫安說，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"『看啊，你的拯救者帶著獎賞和報酬來了！』」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們將被稱為聖民，是耶和華救贖的人。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你將被稱為蒙眷愛、不再被撇棄的城。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/62.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/63.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/61.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":12}